From 342916f6c47f12ee86cf78a7558fe1b76df65ff2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Telaak <joseph@telaak.dev>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:54:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: clock: Add Siflower SF19A2890 system manager

The system manager of the Siflower SF19A2890 holds the SoC's PLLs and
clock dividers, and for each peripheral a block with its resets and
clock gates. It also holds controls that other devices use, among them
the reboot register, so it is a syscon as well.

Signed-off-by: Joseph Telaak <joseph@telaak.dev>
---
 .../clock/siflower,sf19a2890-sysm.yaml        | 82 +++++++++++++++++++
 MAINTAINERS                                   |  8 ++
 .../clock/siflower,sf19a2890-sysm.h           | 58 +++++++++++++
 .../reset/siflower,sf19a2890-sysm.h           | 22 +++++
 4 files changed, 170 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/siflower,sf19a2890-sysm.yaml
 create mode 100644 include/dt-bindings/clock/siflower,sf19a2890-sysm.h
 create mode 100644 include/dt-bindings/reset/siflower,sf19a2890-sysm.h

